    "title": "The Breakdown: Juneteenth events in New Orleans - NewsBreak",
    "text": "New Orleans\nThe Breakdown: Juneteenth events in New Orleans\n2 hours ago\nNEW ORLEANS — There are plenty of events popping up on Thursday, June 19th, to celebrate the Juneteenth holiday – the day all Americans were made truly free. At 9:30 a.m. on Thursday in Armstrong Park, the city will help cut the ribbon on a new art exhibition featuring sculptural drums, called The Stories of Us in New Orleans.",
